                                        K - 5   = Nr of Translation Units Along C-Axis

Ring Closure Links are Indicated with 'R' and Infinite Chain Links With 'T' 
                                                                                            "7042499   "  PLATON-COORDN    Page   53
====================================================================================================================================
Analysis of the Coordination Geometry
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Distances are calculated from atom I of Unique Molecule Coordinate List to atom J in Asymmetric Residue Unit: ARU.

Phi = Azimuth angle(counter clockwise from XO in XO,YO-Plane), Mu  = Angle between D and XO,YO-plane.

'To-Code' : '--' = Bonded atoms,  '<<' = < sum vdW-radii - 0.2, '.<' = < sum vdW-radii, '..' = > sum vdW-radii.

